                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c09230e2-39dc-47cf-9b4a-bbd182a3f97f",
                                                "sense_id": "51eb7ceb-aaa7-3c5a-9bdb-a06a21c4c012",
                                                "text": "At lunch the excellent cold borscht could lead up to the herring sampler featuring rollmops, Swedish matjes and pickled herring, which has immediately joined the small list of dishes whose flavor helps define New York."
